# Study artefacts: regenerable, never committed.
# Leading slash anchors these to the repository root. Unanchored, `data/` also
# matched `src/footy/data/` and silently kept the entire ingest package out of
# version control — invisible, because `git status` stays clean for ignored paths.
/data/
/results/
/paper/figures/*.pdf
/paper/figures/*.png

